{"displayStem":"두 항균제에 대한 MIC는 모두 1 mg/L였다. 같은 접종량에서 24시간 노출한 뒤 약물을 제거하고 회수한 생존 농도를 그렸다. 회수 대조는 정상이다. 이 문항에서는 시작 생균의 99.9% 이상을 감소시키는 최소 시험 농도를 MBC로 정의한다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 교육용 합성값이다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성자료 · 점 사이 직선은 관찰 순서 연결","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 500\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 합성자료 비교 그래프\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"500\" fill=\"white\"></rect><path d=\"M110 100V365H740\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M110 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"110\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M187.5 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"187.5\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M265 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"265\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M420 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"420\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M730 365v8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"730\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><path d=\"M102 365h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M102 280h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"289\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><path d=\"M102 195h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><path d=\"M102 110h8\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\">24 h 뒤 log10(CFU/mL)</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" text-anchor=\"middle\">노출 농도 (MIC의 배수)</text><line x1=\"130\" x2=\"185\" y1=\"75\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\"></line><text x=\"200\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"26\" style=\"font-size:26px\">가</text><polyline points=\"110,110 187.5,152.5 265,237.5 420,280 730,322.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\"></polyline><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"187.5\" cy=\"152.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"265\" cy=\"237.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"280\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"730\" cy=\"322.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"445\" x2=\"500\" y1=\"75\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 6\"></line><text x=\"515\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"26\" style=\"font-size:26px\">나</text><polyline points=\"110,110 187.5,131.25 265,152.5 420,195 730,237.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"9 6\"></polyline><rect x=\"106\" y=\"106\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"183.5\" y=\"127.25\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"261\" y=\"148.5\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"416\" y=\"191\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"726\" y=\"233.5\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect></svg></div></div>"]}